ca Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">xAI 发布 Grok Bot 智能体，为 AI 配备专属云端电脑实现自主工作</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI 正式发布 ChatGPT Linux 桌面预览版，支持 Ubuntu、Debian 与 Fedora</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Google Gemma 4系列模型全球下载量正式突破3亿大关</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里云灵骏真武M890超节点上线，国内首个跑通超2万亿参数大模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/96be815c6ac81d9ff05a839af2088d38.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里云正式上线灵骏真武M890超节点实例，该产品是国内首个成功运行超2万亿参数大模型的算力平台，目前已支持Kimi K3及Qwen3.8 Max（2.4万亿参数）对外服务。该实例搭载平头哥真武M890训推一体AI芯片，配合ICN Switch 1.0互联芯片，实现64卡间800GB/s高速互联及9TB显存池。通过全链路深度优化，该节点原生支持FP8/FP4低精度计算，在智能驾驶与具身智能训练场景中性能较上一代提升至多3倍，Agentic推理性能提升1.5倍。依托灵骏智算平台与HPN 8.0网络，单实例最高可承载十万亿参数级MoE模型推理，单集群支持13万卡异构算力混布并可弹性扩展至百万卡规模，为大规模AI负载提供高性能算力底座。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯发布二季报：混元Hy3正式上线，资本开支同比增长176%加码AI</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9dbda58b580eb11e1a27f620119fa313.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯发布2026年二季报，核心业务实现双线突破，资本开支达527.8亿元，同比增长176%，持续加码AI基础设施与模型研发。模型层面，混元Hy3完成从preview到正式版的迭代，上线一周调用量较上一代增长超68倍，更大参数规模的Hy4计划近期发布。AI产品方面，WorkBuddy 6月PC端访问量突破2000万次，CodeBuddy持续领跑国内AI原生办公智能体赛道，微信AI助手“小微”正有序灰测放量。财务表现上，腾讯二季度营收2047.9亿元，同比增长11%；Non-IFRS经营利润756.4亿元，同比增长9%。云服务业务受AI增量贡献驱动，表现出强劲增长势头。剔除新AI产品投入影响，Non-IFRS经营利润同比增速达19%，显示出核心业务的稳健盈利能力与AI战略转型的深度协同。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">xAI 发布 Grok Bot 智能体，为 AI 配备专属云端电脑实现自主工作</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/09656903ecd9ae90ac93424907c5c568.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">xAI 正式发布测试版产品 Grok Bot，旨在将 AI 智能体从聊天工具转型为具备专属云端电脑的“常驻员工”。该产品支持智能体在无人监督下独立完成多步骤任务，即使关闭本地设备，任务仍可在云端持续推进。用户可通过桌面端或 iOS 与 Bot 交互，通过现场演示即可让 Bot 学习并重复工作流。多个 Bot 可并行运行、互相协作及派发任务。Grok Bot 不单独销售，而是深度捆绑至 Cursor Ultra（200美元/月）、Cursor Premium Teams（120美元/席位/月）及 SuperGrok Heavy 订阅层级中。xAI 内部已将其应用于销售外呼、营销、办公室运营及 bug 修复等岗位。该策略通过与 Cursor 基础设施深度集成，降低了智能体部署成本。目前企业客户需通过候补名单申请，A</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI 正式发布 ChatGPT Linux 桌面预览版，支持 Ubuntu、Debian 与 Fedora</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/582a5a22738f6362a99e79de2688fac9.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI 正式推出 ChatGPT Linux 桌面预览版，将 ChatGPT、ChatGPT Work 及 Codex 功能整合至统一窗口，补齐了继 macOS 和 Windows 后的桌面端拼图。该应用提供 DEB 和 RPM 安装包，支持 x64 与 ARM64 架构，官方适配 Ubuntu 24.04/26.04 LTS、Debian 13 及 Fedora 43/44。核心亮点在于 Codex 的原生集成，允许开发者直接调用本地仓库、编辑文件、读取 git 历史并执行终端命令，无需上传云端。相比 Anthropic 此前发布的 Claude Linux 桌面版，OpenAI 此举旨在通过系统级权限的常驻应用争夺开发者生态。目前该预览版尚未实现功能全对齐，Voice for Work、内置浏览器及原</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Google Gemma 4系列模型全球下载量正式突破3亿大关</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/24419041183e297530bcace62dcd166f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Google Gemma 4系列模型全球下载量已正式突破3亿大关，该数据在Google I/O上海期间对外公布。Gemma 4于今年4月正式发布，作为专为高级推理和智能体（Agentic）工作流设计的人工智能模型，自推出以来便在开发者群体中获得广泛应用。此次下载量突破3亿的里程碑，标志着该模型在AI开发生态中已占据重要地位。Gemma 4通过优化推理能力与工作流集成，满足了当前市场对高效能AI模型的需求，其快速增长的下载量反映了全球开发者对该系列模型在构建复杂AI应用方面的高度认可，进一步推动了智能体技术在行业内的落地与普及。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
